// ROADMAP CHECKLIST — all tasks implemented
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
// Phase 1: Core Game Foundation
//   1. [x] Grid & Path System .............. src/game.js (buildMap, pointAtDist)
//   2. [x] Game State Machine .............. src/game.js (phase), src/ui.js
//   3. [x] Game Loop Execution ............ src/ui.js (frame, fixed timestep)
//   4. [x] Player Economy ................. src/game.js (credits, placeTower)
//   5. [x] Wave Spawner ................... src/game.js (composeWave, startWave)
//   6. [x] Difficulty Scaling ............. src/game.js (hpScale), src/config.js
//
// Phase 2: Tower System
//   7. [x] Tower Placement Logic .......... src/game.js (canPlace, placeTower)
//   8. [x] Tower Type Definitions ......... src/config.js (TOWERS)
//   9. [x] Targeting Priority ............. src/game.js (findTarget)
//  10. [x] Projectile Mechanics ........... src/game.js (fire, impact)
//  11. [x] Upgrade Tiers .................. src/game.js (upgradeTower)
//  12. [x] Sell & Refund Logic ............ src/game.js (sellTower, 70%)
//
// Phase 3: Enemy System
//  13. [x] Enemy Attribute Framework ...... src/game.js (spawnEnemy)
